      "body": "```C\r\npickle_free(void *mod)\r\n{\r\n    PyObject *m = (PyObject*)mod;\r\n    _Pickle_ClearState(_Pickle_GetState(m));\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think most of the free functions use m, mod or module for the free function of module. Maybe use `m` and do an inline cast. Or just do:\r\n\r\n```c\r\npickle_free(void *m) {\r\n    (void)pickle_clear((PyObject *)m);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhich is what we usuaslly do.",
